            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Fixes Perch staying untrusted after an upgrade from an older build: "Grant Accessibility access…" now clears Perch's outdated permission entry and asks macOS to add it again.</li>
<li>Perch notices the permission as soon as you turn it on, without a restart.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
